sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If as many numbers as we please in continued proportion are the least of those which have the same ratio with them, then the extremes of them are relatively prime.
----
proof:

Let as many numbers as we please, *A, B, C,* and *D,* in continued proportion be the least of those which have the same ratio with them.

I say that the extremes of them, *A* and *D,* are relatively prime.

